şiir yazdım sana

anlatacaktım iki dizeyle

yarım kalan aşk’ımı

ağladı şiir 

beyaz yemiş düşlere

01.01.06.. 07.46', 'nerden geldi diyeceksin ama gitmiştim yine geldim söylüyorum hep  uzaklara  gitsem de ben hep sendeyim sözlerin düşüyor aklıma geliyordum gi...', ARRAY['Türk Edebiyatı','Şiir','Birsen Ateş']::text[], 8.5, '{"poet":"Birsen Ateş","poet_slug":"birsen-ates","theme":"Türk Şiiri","is_hero":false,"total_lines":17,"source_url":"https://www.antoloji.com/sozlerin-dusuyor-aklima-siiri/"}'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO contents (type, title, slug, cover_image, backdrop_image, content_text, summary, genres, global_rating, metadata) VALUES ('poem', 'Semi-exing''s not a Styks', 'semi-exing-s-not-a-styks-akin-akca-u68gn', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519682337058-a94d519337bc?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519682337058-a94d519337bc?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80', 'Standing in the middle as always the semi-axe; However, its a labrys also, from ‘snowyhook amazonas’.

Standing there’s me while i’m near to you as always; As always, you’re the semi-ex, don’t you? 

So you don’t give up ‘n fly away, at least life’s grey; Oh semi-ex lover, as always is it somewhat a trap? 

Are you jokin’ when you’re mercyho lily in very much business; When somebody’s sick, one cannot easily jogging.

At that moment, whatever you are thinking; It’s a horrified joke as always, now-times i mean.

Cos you’re the witness of that theft in the future: Breaking up is not real for us, pray at least..

..But not last, you have PP degree as shaping dignity, Whenever you would come, this side is my agree.

For these eyes, me as known; lust’s luscious; Those eyes you’ve, for ‘em love’s a kinda render.

If you come, will understand, you sholdn’t be my ex; Null, you become a nonsense; if you don’t.

You’re on the roof, looking at a diesel’d gargoyle. “But is it me? ” i hear you said: don’t be sad.

“I’ve the semi-ex in the neighbourhood o’ a labrys axe As always”; ‘it’s hard but not last’, whispers Styx.

It’s not a despise that you really do segregate; You supposed as i’m sos o mad to be as society.

Society is thought as gender moreover, even. Why you’re behaving like this, is crise a door? 

Don’t remit it; love’s not gonna be rememberance Haven’t you caused the semi-disaster, before i beckon.

That’s why, time’s equaled itself now, like worry. Say no sorry; i wait for you, nuthin’ much nuthin’ less.

Anut your hands, they still are mine, you are yours. Youa messages don’t reflect any border, any sunset.

MathSpace has its CygNatura curves God bless These are proof; except this, what remains? 

Emotions’re attached for our walnut brains are us, Sümüklüböcek too are galaxy cluster, cluster grapes.

If he do know that everyone has got the same lying; So they haven’t got lies, behavioural value’d ouacasely –

Biscuits as celcius in a world milk tank is 3C`’s; As AAA symmetry; especially for innerside

Here there was a hide with Aa, Ab, Ac, not Az…

---

Sözlükçe (adı üstünde, kısa sözlük arge çalışması,sondaj :)) 

Semi prod (yarı türetmeceler) 

1.PP: pride of patience 

3C’s: circuit circus circumstances (elektrik devre sirk koşulları) 

Ouacasely: occasionally

Snowyhook: karlıçengel(i) 

2.Render: (yardımhizmet)  etmek, sağlamak

3.Lust: Şehvet

4.Luscious: yemesi çok lezzetli ve tatlı

5.Styks: eski yunan’daki hades’in kharon’un nehri

6.Diesel, diesel engine; dizel motoru; sıkıştırılmış hava içine püskürtülen yakıtla çalışan motor.

7.Gargoyle: bir bina (genl. Kilise)  damının knarında taştan, veya metalden yapılmış çirkin bir insan ya da hayvan başı  taş oluk.  Yağmur suları bu heykelciklerin ağzından aşağıya dökülür.

8.Segregate: toplumsal bir grubu geri kalanlardan ayırmak

9.Desegregate: ırk ayrımını ortadan kaldırmak

1o.Despise: küçümsemek

11.Beckon: el ile işaret etme, el ile işr. Edip çağırma

12.Clearence: açma, giderme, temizleme işi

13.Remit: küçümsemek

14.MarthSpace: uzay (soyut)  matematik

Türetmeceler:

1.CygNatura: Cygnus yıldız+doğa katkı maddeli bir “signature” ifade ediş biçimi.

Asıl anlamı imza yani.

2.Sos o: ‘so so’ anlamında veya rastl. Ortaya çıkan biçimiyle ‘sos o’; s.o.s+ooo nidası, bir sergilenene inanmama belirteci. ‘so so’ yarım yamalak anlamında değil, böylece

3.semi-exing: ikincilliği devre dışı kalmamış sevgili (yarı daima gibisinden) 

4.Anut: And/But (ve ama) 

